Subject: [PATCH] hlsdemux2: take the exact time of MPEG-TS and packed audio segments

hlsdemux2 compares the stream time a segment got from the summed EXTINF
durations with the one from its MPEG time, and only takes the latter above
100 ms. The first buffer of a fragment carries the stream time. Below the
tolerance a packed audio rendition stays shifted against the variant, ZDF
lists its audio segments as 2.005 s, and after a variant switch tsdemux
anchors the new variant on an estimate that is off by the change of the
PTS/DTS distance.

Take the exact time for MPEG-TS and packed audio segments within half a
segment duration, for the segment and the fragment.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
--- a/ext/adaptivedemux2/hls/gsthlsdemux-stream.c
+++ b/ext/adaptivedemux2/hls/gsthlsdemux-stream.c
@@ -572,6 +572,26 @@
       " difference against expected : %" GST_STIME_FORMAT,
       GST_STIME_ARGS (real_stream_time), GST_STIME_ARGS (difference));
 
+  /* MPEG-TS and packed audio carry the exact time of each segment while the
+   * playlist durations are rounded. Within the tolerance below the stream
+   * time estimated from the durations would stay. A fragment is timed from its
+   * first buffer on, after a variant switch or for a packed audio rendition
+   * the estimate would shift audio and video against each other. */
+  if ((hls_stream->parser_type == GST_HLS_PARSER_ID3
+          || hls_stream->parser_type == GST_HLS_PARSER_MPEGTS) && difference != 0
+      && !hls_stream->in_partial_segments
+      && ABS (difference) <= (GstClockTimeDiff) (current_segment->duration / 2)) {
+    GST_DEBUG_OBJECT (hls_stream,
+        "Exact segment time, updating current stream time to %" GST_STIME_FORMAT,
+        GST_STIME_ARGS (real_stream_time));
+    current_segment->stream_time = real_stream_time;
+    gst_hls_media_playlist_recalculate_stream_time (hls_stream->playlist,
+        current_segment);
+    GST_ADAPTIVE_DEMUX2_STREAM_CAST (hls_stream)->fragment.stream_time =
+        real_stream_time;
+    return GST_HLS_PARSER_RESULT_DONE;
+  }
+
   /* We allow a tolerance of 3-4 frames between the estimated and observed
    * stream time. */
   if (ABS (difference) > 100 * GST_MSECOND) {
